  designNotes: 'Gamble, accelerationism''s way: every outcome pays, one only after
    it hurts. Your creatures take 2 and get +3 Attack for good (on the brink, then
    boom), or +2/+2 for good, or Borrowed Time until the next Dusk.'
  artDescription: A tech founder in a hoodie flooring the accelerator of a rocket-powered
    car toward a cliff edge, the road on fire behind him, a bridge of glowing circuit
    boards assembling itself in mid-air just ahead of the wheels.
